{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao02_title", "source_sha256": "8cedeefb3f9b3cfacaab6da1ea49fadece6c8acacd1381c77c3d60f7a0385033", "ja": "奈緒とおでかけ2", "zh": "与奈绪外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6171f24d771b1a9703cc5aa34a4504bd3105e26dda95feb3e82da2ea57e0a582", "ja": "奈緒とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "与奈绪出门外出的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0b61d09a89c104b9684836a7c5d58581fc7da2dae6813c85a37c7395829eb47f", "ja": "（青森での仕事の後、浅虫に宿をとった。\n有名な浅虫温泉、みんな堪能してくれてるかな）", "zh": "（在青森的工作结束后，订了浅虫的旅馆。\n有名的浅虫温泉，大家都享受得尽兴吗）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao02_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "a28b769a515d44872287f80bc0e5b399c7fe3e53798d50bbd450dbf215e91a21", "ja": "{$P$}さん、今からお風呂ですか？\nいやーいいお湯でしたわー！　ホンマにいい泉質で♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你现在要去泡温泉吗？\n哎呀～水温真是舒服啊！泉质也真的超级棒♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "03d3820adbe2f665ffb83fad27f6c46ef05781696f85783bb5b03ad86365f0cd", "ja": "奈緒、もう入って来たのか。そうか……奈緒が\nいいお湯だと言うなら、期待が高まるな……。", "zh": "奈绪，你已经泡完了啊。这样啊……既然奈绪\n都说是好温泉，那可越来越让人期待了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao02_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "5d9d81f2eb23c79a6326b27fafc2ffac12a46aa26cf392bb621877d09e7a66ef", "ja": "期待を裏切らない、メッチャ素晴らしい温泉ですよ！\n眺めもいいです！　すごいオーシャンビューで♪", "zh": "这可是绝对不会让人失望、超棒的温泉哦！\n景色也很赞！能看到一望无际的大海呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "09dcd84a385c20ee414a478ae1e7712ebf522646d83114b8264e50a5e94548cf", "ja": "オーシャンビュー……なるほど。\nよし、行ってこようかな。", "zh": "海景……原来如此。\n好，那我就去看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao02_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "ffef65043c34f9dafeb4ef1d0b407a74f209beb9b98967d4d4d3b82ac2241317", "ja": "いってらっしゃーい。\n……あ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "一路顺风——\n……啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao02_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "db392e64031b90770b8ac1ced0baef4c50eebd02abfdd1ef770ef5f653d79b02", "ja": "こんな良いとこ連れてきてくれて、その……\nありがとうございます。", "zh": "带我来这么好的地方，还有那个……谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao02_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "c1a8c571cf5527098efefe0e209a43cae06d4424044fffca9f3ee63fb0bd6fe9", "ja": "えへへ！　温泉で心も体もあったかくなったんで、\n感謝したくなったんです！　ほな！", "zh": "嘿嘿！泡了温泉，身心都暖和起来了，\n所以就想向你道谢！那我先走啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e73ec1562421d3668b2e06d20f4738590a1d6e09c080cf4001dfe2fed674a12c", "ja": "（そう言って奈緒はマッサージチェアの方に向かった。\n湯上りはあれに座って、奈緒がいたら話をしよう）", "zh": "说完，奈绪朝按摩椅走去。泡完澡就坐到那个上面，要是奈绪还在的话，就和她聊聊天吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
